INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `content`, `image`, `meta`, `short_desc`, `keyphrase`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Can I switch from Mounjaro to the Wegovy pill?', 1, '<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Yes — the Medicines and Healthcare Regulatory Agency (MHRA) approved <a type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.simpleonlinepharmacy.co.uk/weight-loss/wegovy-pill/\" id=\"https://www.simpleonlinepharmacy.co.uk/weight-loss/wegovy-pill/\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20px;\">the Wegovy pill</a> on 11 June 2026, making it the first GLP-1 weight loss tablet licensed in the UK.</span> It can be prescribed to adults with a BMI of 30 or above, or a BMI between 27 and 30 with at least one weight-related health condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, or raised cholesterol. <a href=\"https://www.simpleonlinepharmacy.co.uk/health-advice/weight-loss/wegovy-pill/switching-to-wegovy-pill/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://www.simpleonlinepharmacy.co.uk/health-advice/weight-loss/wegovy-pill/switching-to-wegovy-pill/\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\">Switching to the Wegovy pill</a> from Mounjaro follows our published protocol.</p><h2 id=\"h-why-do-people-switch-from-mounjaro-to-the-wegovy-pill\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 18, 63); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 30.39px; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 26px; margin-top: 20px; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">Why do people switch from Mounjaro to the Wegovy pill?</h2><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">There can various reason to switch from Mounjaro to the Wegovy pill such as convenience, side effects or pricing.</span> Eli Lilly increased the UK list price of <a href=\"https://pharmaceutical-journal.com/article/news/uks-biggest-online-pharmacy-freezes-mounjaro-price-amid-reports-of-stockpiling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\">Mounjaro by up to 170% from 1 September 2025</a>. Anyone on the higher Mounjaro doses privately saw monthly costs double overnight.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">Mounjaro supply problems have previously been problematic, but these have eased through 2026. Affordability is now the main concern for most patients. UK pricing for the Wegovy pill currently sits below Mounjaro, particularly as you step up through the doses. The tablet does not need cold storage or an expensive pen device, which keeps costs lower.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">The <font color=\"#1d5cff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; line-height: 20px;\">SELECT trial</span></font> gave injectable Wegovy to over 17,000 adults with heart disease for three and a half years. The trial suggests that the risk of heart attack, stroke, and death from heart disease in those who had already experienced these before dropped by roughly 20%.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><br></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><a href=\"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ta1152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\">NICE</a> (the National Institute for Health and Care Excellence) subsequently recommended Wegovy injections for NHS prescribing in May 2026. Available for adults with a BMI of at least 27 who have had a heart attack, stroke, or poor circulation in the legs. The Wegovy pill <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">may</span> receive similar NHS approval at a later date, though this has not been confirmed. <a href=\"https://www.simpleonlinepharmacy.co.uk/health-advice/weight-loss/wegovy/switching-mounjaro-to-wegovy/\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\">Switching from Mounjaro to Wegovy injections</a> is an option if you want to benefit now.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">Some patients simply prefer a daily pill when weighing up their weight loss options. Needle anxiety is a factor for many. For others, the real concern is fitting injections around travel and daily routine.</p><h2 id=\"h-will-i-lose-less-weight-on-the-wegovy-pill-than-on-mounjaro\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 18, 63); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 30.39px; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 26px; margin-top: 20px; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">Will I lose less weight on the Wegovy pill than on Mounjaro?</h2><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">You should expect slightly less weight loss on average.</span><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40353578/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\"> A Wegovy pill vs Mounjaro head-to-head trial has not yet been carried out, but SURMOUNT-5</a> compared the two weight loss injections directly. Over 750 adults with obesity took either Mounjaro or Wegovy for 72 weeks. Mounjaro users saw an average of 20% weight loss compared to around 14% with Wegovy injections.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">The <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40934115/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 92, 255); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; line-height: 20px;\">OASIS 4</a> trial followed 307 adults with overweight or obesity for 64 weeks. Weight loss results on the Wegovy 25 mg tablet averaged around 14%, similar to the injection. For many people, the heart benefit or lower cost outweighs a smaller weight loss number than with Mounjaro.</p><h2 id=\"h-how-long-do-i-wait-between-stopping-mounjaro-and-starting-the-wegovy-pill\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 18, 63); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 30.39px; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 26px; margin-top: 20px; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\">How long do I wait between stopping Mounjaro and starting the Wegovy pill?</h2><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">We advise a one-week gap between your last dose of Mounjaro and your first Wegovy pill. </span>You should start the pill on your next scheduled Mounajro injection day.<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> </span>Tirzepatide takes four to five weeks to fully leave your system, but a seven-day gap is enough to reduce the risk of overlapping the two weight loss treatments and their potential side effects.&nbsp;</p><div data-elementor-type=\"container\" data-elementor-id=\"19406\" class=\"elementor elementor-19406\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 36); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d726aa8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"d726aa8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\" style=\"--flex-direction: row; --flex-wrap: initial; --justify-content: center; --align-items: initial; --align-content: initial; --gap: 20px 20px; --flex-basis: auto; --flex-grow: 0; --flex-shrink: 1; --order: initial; --align-self: center; flex: 0 1 auto; order: 0; align-self: center; flex-flow: row; place-content: normal center; align-items: normal; gap: 20px; --border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 20px; --border-top-width: 0px; --border-right-width: 0px; --border-bottom-width: 0px; --border-left-width: 0px; --border-style: initial; --border-color: initial; --container-widget-width: initial; --container-widget-height: 100%; --container-widget-flex-grow: 1; --container-widget-align-self: stretch; --content-width: min(100%,1200px); --width: 100%; --min-height: 0px; --height: auto; --text-align: initial; --margin-top: 25px; --margin-right: 0px; --margin-bottom: 15px; --margin-left: 0px; --padding-top: 15px; --padding-right: 15px; --padding-bottom: 15px; --padding-left: 15px; --position: relative; --z-index: revert; --overflow: visible; --overlay-mix-blend-mode: initial; --overlay-opacity: 1; --overlay-transition: 0.3s; --e-con-grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); --e-con-grid-template-rows: repeat(2,1fr); position: relative; width: 100%; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; height: auto; border-radius: 20px; z-index: auto; overflow: v