(1, 'Expert Online Pharmacy', 'The Simpler, Safer way to pay and get paid', '<h3>What to Expect from the Project</h3>\n\n<p>When using this charity and fundraising platform, customers can expect a streamlined, transparent, and user-friendly process for managing and supporting charitable causes. Service providers can set up a fundraiser quickly, specifying the percentage of funds that will go directly to the person or cause in need, while a pre-determined portion goes to the influencer facilitating the campaign. Donors can expect a secure platform to contribute towards causes they care about, with confidence that their donations are allocated exactly as specified.</p>\n\n<h3>Why This Project?</h3>\n\n<p>The project was built to address common issues in charity and fundraising platforms, including lack of transparency, complicated fund allocation, and mistrust between donors and beneficiaries. It bridges the gap by offering a straightforward model where contributors know exactly how their donations are split. The platform allows service providers to set clear rules for fund distribution, making it easier to build trust and establish credibility with potential donors.</p>\n\n<h3>Benefits It Brings</h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Transparency</strong>: Contributors can see precisely how funds are distributed, which helps build trust and ensures donations are used for the intended purpose.</li>\n	<li><strong>Efficiency</strong>: The platform simplifies the setup process for fundraising campaigns, allowing service providers to focus on spreading their message and reaching potential donors.</li>\n	<li><strong>Fair Compensation</strong>: Influencers who facilitate fundraising receive a portion of the contributions, providing them with an incentive to support various causes actively.</li>\n	<li><strong>Security</strong>: With strict terms and conditions prohibiting the use of funds for illegal activities, donors can be confident that their contributions will not be misused.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dispute Resolution</strong>: The platform offers tools for addressing disputes, providing users with support if any issues arise during transactions.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3>What Sets It Apart</h3>\n\n<p>This project differentiates itself from other fundraising platforms by focusing on a rule-based distribution model that ensures clarity and accountability in how funds are allocated. Unlike traditional platforms where fees or ambiguous fund allocation might concern contributors, this project provides a transparent mechanism where service providers define the distribution percentage upfront. Moreover, it incorporates strict terms to prevent misuse of funds for illegal activities, further protecting the integrity of the platform and building trust within the community.</p>\n\n<p>By combining transparency, ease of use, security, and fair compensation for influencers, this platform aims to revolutionize the way charitable donations are managed and distributed.</p>\n', 'logo.png', '+254700000000', 'sales@expertonline', 2023, 'KES', 10, NULL, 'Eastern Bypass - Marjo Complex', 'icon.png', '50.048466952995', 'Tokens are not crypto', 'false', 'This app has been disabled. Please update from the playstore', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'mail.miziziclassifieds.com', 'M2Pay@101', 'noreply@miziziclassifieds.com', '#3cb043', 24, 0, '/public/assets/system/breadcrumb.jpg');

